--cpp14
^\[main\.assertion\.1\] line \d+ namespace scope: SUCCESS$
^\[main\.assertion\.2\] line \d+ static data member: SUCCESS$
^\[main\.assertion\.3\] line \d+ variable template \(C\+\+14\): SUCCESS$
^\[main\.assertion\.4\] line \d+ WRONG \(must FAIL\): FAILURE$
^\*\* 1 of \d+ failed
^VERIFICATION FAILED$
